---
layout: base.njk
title: Logistic Regression Visualizer
icon: fa-percent
navigation:
  - name: "Home"
    link: "index.html"
    icon: "fa-home"
permalink: "logistic-regression.html"
extraScript: "static/js/logistic-regression.js"
tags: visualization
cardTitle: "Logistic Regression"
cardIcon: fa-percent
cardDescription: "Visualize logistic regression with sigmoid function, decision boundary animation, and gradient descent on log-loss."
cardTags:
  - Classification
  - ML Fundamentals
cardHaystack: "logistic regression sigmoid function decision boundary log loss binary classification gradient descent probability"
cardOrder: 18
cardImage: static/img/vis_cards/logistic-regression.png
